WEBVTT

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:30.553
bila kujali pato lao, wala wanakoishi,

00:04:30.553 --> 00:04:33.449
ama jamii inavyonena kuwahusu.

00:04:33.449 --> 00:04:35.386
Patrick, Debbie na Wael

00:04:35.386 --> 00:04:36.769
ni mifano tatu tu

00:04:36.769 --> 00:04:39.170
kati ya wanafunzi 1,700 waliokubaliwa

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.889
kutoka nchi 143.

00:04:42.889 --> 00:04:48.150
Sisi - (Makofi) - Asanteni.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.307
Hatukuitaji kuibuka na gurudumu jipya.

00:04:50.307 --> 00:04:52.605
Tuliangalia tu ni kipi kilikuwa hakifaulu

00:04:52.605 --> 00:04:55.572
na kutumia nguvu ya ajabu ya intaneti

00:04:55.572 --> 00:04:57.466
kukizingira.

00:04:57.466 --> 00:05:00.349
Tuliamua kujenga muundo